      * Sample suite in the CBLT DSL. Any line that is not a DSL keyword
      * is plain COBOL and is copied as is.
       TESTSUITE TSTDISC 'Discounts by amount'

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-AMOUNT                 PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  WS-RESULT                 PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  WS-CATEGORY               PIC X(10).
           88  WS-IS-PREMIUM         VALUE "PREMIUM".

       BEFORE-EACH
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RESULT
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-CATEGORY
       END-BEFORE

       TESTCASE 'premium amount gets 20%'
           MOVE 2000 TO WS-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING WS-AMOUNT WS-RESULT WS-CATEGORY
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 1600
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'
           EXPECT WS-IS-PREMIUM TO BE TRUE
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY TO CONTAIN 'PREM'
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE GREATER THAN 1000
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE BETWEEN 1500 AND 1700
           DISPLAY "premium result: " WS-RESULT

       TESTCASE 'basic amount gets no discount'
           MOVE 100 TO WS-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING WS-AMOUNT WS-RESULT WS-CATEGORY
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 100
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY NOT TO BE 'PREMIUM'
           EXPECT WS-IS-PREMIUM TO BE FALSE
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE LESS THAN WS-AMOUNT + 1

       TESTCASE 'intentional failure to show the report'
           MOVE 700 TO WS-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING WS-AMOUNT WS-RESULT WS-CATEGORY
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 700
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY TO BE 'STANDARD'

       IGNORE
       TESTCASE 'pending: negative amounts'
           MOVE 0 TO WS-AMOUNT
           EXPECT WS-RESULT TO BE ZEROS
